    "detailed_description": "\u300aDream World Adventure\u300b is a cute and casual Roguelike game. In the dream world, you need to face various cute but aggressive monsters. Choose different weapon props combinations to eliminate groups of enemies.<br>Choose your character, survive as long as possible in this dangerous dream world, and then fight your way out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features </h2>Weapons are preset to automatic shooting!<br>Fast pace (no more than 20 minutes per game)!<br>Different characters have different initial weapons and attributes<br>Multiple skill props combinations for you to choose!<br>Pick up experience to upgrade, and select weapons and props on the upgrade page!<br>Multiple difficulty options: high-difficulty enemies have higher health and damage, challenge different difficulties~",
